<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zycon said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zycon said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Needham upgraded Zycon Corp to buy from hold and raised its share earnings estimate for 1997 to $1.25 from $1.05, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Needham also saw prospects for another &quot;excellent&quot; year for EPS growth in 1998 that could equal or exceed 25 percent and reach $1.55, the source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 10-3/4.</p>
</text>
